WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.544
Today brings your chosen activities and due
routines together. Imagine it

00:00:04.544 --> 00:00:08.838
is Thursday: family dates this morning, school
pickup at three, and

00:00:08.838 --> 00:00:10.400
one box to sort.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:15.488
Asking about dates is the activity already
chosen for Thursday in

00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:16.350
your week.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.629
School pickup is an existing routine. It needs
no bigger goal

00:00:20.629 --> 00:00:21.700
to belong here.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:26.496
You also choose today for sorting one box,
without a precise

00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:26.900
time.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.550
Trace that activity upward: sorting a box
supports a clear floor

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.850
this month, a usable spare room this quarter,
and a calmer

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:37.150
home this year. Today and Week show the same
activity, not

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:40.450
two copies. Completing it is one step toward
those goals. You

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.550
decide when the bigger goals are complete.
